  "title": "記憶",
  "storyCode": "3-2",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "809a4642f9651cfcc159a24339612cd94b39c2d54ab917e477d64076e0d56d93",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十四关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "你就是米莎吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "你好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "......聽碎骨他說了好久，今天，終於見到你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "......你也是......感染者......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "為什麼要加入......整合運動？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "我的妻子，孩子......都死在切爾諾伯格人的手裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "烏薩斯感染者的遭遇，比牲畜還不如。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "毀滅切爾諾伯格——？作為復仇，太輕了，太輕了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "他們手上有多少感染者的血？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "米莎——我們被人恐懼，被人愚弄，被人侮辱，被人迫害——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "——只因我們是感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "僅僅是這樣而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "我，我有些激動，忘了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "伊萬，來幫忙接下傷患。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "這個廢棄礦場只是臨時據點，大家在這裡暫時整頓一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "等到時機成熟，我們就撤回切爾諾伯格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "......亞——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "我已經捨棄了那個名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "為什麼......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "過去的那個人已經死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "叫我碎骨就可以了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "你——是不是有點害怕？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "碎......骨？......為什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "呵......你會明白的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "大家知道你流落龍門之後，都自告奮勇的要把你救出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "在龍門，我們也接納了許多感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "——但你們......在傷害別人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "我不願意......我不想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "感染者為什麼要互相......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "以眼還眼，理所應當。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "烏薩斯人說，對待親人，就該像春天一樣溫暖......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "但對待敵人————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": ".................."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "......你知道嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "不——你——你不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "他們來抓我時，我被拖出了家門去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "我看見媽媽她，抓著我的手......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "你看見的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "......不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "你一定——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "他們毆打媽媽，媽媽不肯鬆手......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "他們在雪地上拖出一條血路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "如果整合運動......如果感染者能......如果————！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "如果能早一些的話，早一些的話！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "我們感染者就不用遭遇那麼多苦難了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "我......我......我沒敢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "......我......嗚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "米莎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "會好的......一切都會好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "我不怪你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "當時......誰有勇氣呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "但至少現在，整合運動給了我勇氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "亞......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "碎骨......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "你可以選擇，不去相信我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "——即便你相信我們了，你也可以選擇，不加入我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "但你是一個感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "整合運動......一定會為了感染者的自由戰鬥到底。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "可你們......摧毀了切爾諾伯格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "有無數無辜的人死去——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "——無辜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "呵，誰是無辜的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "切爾諾伯格實行隔離制度時，有誰反對過嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "在我們被拖去礦場，在烏薩斯把我們丟棄在礦場和凍野，任由我們在寒冬中死去時，有誰反對過嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "有誰，站出來，反對過嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "我，我不知道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "......整合運動有這樣兩個領袖，他們與烏薩斯戰鬥了很長時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "他們說過，是有那麼些烏薩斯人，也在為了感染者，與烏薩斯抗爭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "但他們不在切爾諾伯格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "切爾諾伯格冷眼看著我們死去——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "不，切爾諾伯格樂於看到我們死去！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "切爾諾伯格，是一座理當被毀滅的城市！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "我也遇到過別的幫助感染者的人......他們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "羅德島？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "明明是感染者，卻幫助龍門，傷害我們？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "殺死我們的同胞，殘害我們的兄弟？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "你看不清事實。但你現在該看清了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "......對不起，我太生氣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "沒事......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "......我理解你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "這麼長時間以來，你過得......很辛苦吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "大家都過得很痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "而現在，至少每個人都抱著希望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "塔露拉......是她帶領感染者，反抗殘忍的一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "整合運動就是我們的希望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "......果然大家，都吃過很多苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "如果整合運動真的能保護他們的話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "當然了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "就像整合運動會保護大家......我也會保護你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "碎骨",
      "speakerId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "再也不會讓你受傷了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "————碎骨......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "唔，找到了——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "看來他們的損失不小呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "還好沒回公司......不然又要兜一大圈再出來執行任務了呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "預估一下整合運動的撤退路線。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "把大致路線和方位一起，全都發給阿米婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "很快的，馬上就好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "——嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "我們可不能讓整合運動太閒著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "嗯嗯，大概......這樣......這裡......差不多了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "準備好了嗎，能天使？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "要做什麼？該怎麼做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "先做點熱身運動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "就從他們的崗哨開始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
